Subject: [PATCH] Let ECM select QML linkage from BUILD_SHARED_LIBS

ECM already appends STATIC or SHARED. Passing SHARED as an unparsed
argument conflicts with the static profile and makes qt_add_qml_module fail.

--- a/qmlmodules/components/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/qmlmodules/components/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -5,7 +5,6 @@
     ecm_add_qml_module(kritaqmlcomponents
         URI "org.krita.components"
         VERSION 1.0
-        SHARED
         GENERATE_PLUGIN_SOURCE
     )
 
